{"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.097232394759754426,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.12922819543022079,"h":0.015987206404004084,"c":1,"w":0.11384451548258462},{"t":"HAZEL:","h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.14244186020411198,"x":0.13168724332742782,"w":0.045267489751180001,"c":1},{"w":0.034979422887166323,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.17296511617344767,"c":1,"t":"TOM:","x":0.12962963002375225},{"w":0.045267489751180029,"h":0.010174418787512574,"t":"HAZEL:","y":0.21511627887659257,"x":0.13168724302564455,"c":1},{"h":0.0072674419910804255,"t":"TOM.","x":0.12962963002375225,"y":0.23110465107477229,"w":0.034979422887166323,"c":1},{"t":"HAZEL:","x":0.12962963021166138,"y":0.24273255842010932,"h":0.013081394460653484,"c":1,"w":0.047325102488199849},{"y":0.26017441851663281,"c":1,"t":"тOM.","x":0.13168724297019427,"w":0.032921810150146502,"h":0.0072674419910803145},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"HAZEL:","w":0.047325102488199849,"y":0.35901162765713579,"c":1,"x":0.12962963021166138},{"c":1,"t":"TOM:","x":0.13168724317961641,"y":0.38953488361530819,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.03497942288716635},{"y":0.46075581376031349,"w":0.047325102488199877,"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"t":"HAZEL:","x":0.12962963009334863},{"t":"TOM:","y":0.48982558117457753,"w":0.03497942288716635,"x":0.12962963026423577,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"h":0.0088363671050054604,"c":1,"t":"HAZEL:","x":0.1316660586108008,"y":0.55517483968373071,"w":0.047367471059163418},{"w":0.034979422887166323,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.56976744175644611,"c":1,"t":"TOM:","x":0.13168724318604647},{"h":0.011893459989549937,"w":0.049506746927897111,"t":"HAZEL:","c":1,"x":0.1295676144796846,"y":0.61178582803003523},{"t":"TOM:","x":0.13168724339584689,"w":0.037037035624186199,"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.65697674408202744},{"c":1,"t":"HAZEL:","x":0.12962963048047144,"w":0.051440327962239574,"y":0.69912790677535275,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.71366279044783343,"w":0.039094648361206047,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"TOM:","x":0.12962963073194841,"c":1},{"t":"HAZEL:","h":0.0092775656000323448,"y":0.78605889159841991,"c":1,"w":0.047524525324503575,"x":0.13364514464273716},{"w":0.03497942288716635,"x":0.13374485635477074,"y":0.82994186036109741,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"t":"TOM:"},{"x":0.13374485667771074,"w":0.047325102488199877,"y":0.8430232555529491,"c":1,"t":"HAZEL:","h":0.010174418787512574},{"x":0.13374485635477074,"y":0.85901162780295781,"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"TOM:","c":1,"w":0.03497942288716635},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.22016462024646216,"t":"You mean, because there's a big difference between having it on the front page","w":0.59259256998697918,"c":1,"y":0.14098837197301062},{"t":"and the bottom of page ten, for instance?","x":0.22209162719560879,"c":1,"w":0.30895975748697913,"h":0.015393872704747458,"y":0.15477315377549949},{"h":0.016184121054389933,"c":1,"y":0.16855829989225368,"w":0.60504079182942705,"t":"Exactly. And that shows how important the editor thinks the story is. Then there's","x":0.2180632986879768},{"w":0.56805007934570317,"y":0.18309533071349793,"x":0.22011006985787163,"c":1,"h":0.016324765550233655,"t":"the size - how many column inches the story is given, how many columns it"},{"x":0.22222222344760648,"w":0.10288065592447918,"y":0.20053003555195503,"c":1,"t":"spreads over.","h":0.010306242638398078},{"t":"And I suppose that includes the headline.","h":0.014872847513259568,"w":0.31095909118652337,"x":0.22210278608006889,"c":1,"y":0.21192134789755579},{"t":"It certainly does. It's all part of attracting the reader's attention.","y":0.22659513376383278,"w":0.46517562866210938,"c":1,"x":0.22212983141218823,"h":0.014673846349278041},{"w":0.56800486246744786,"x":0.22217654495854466,"y":0.24125217363833551,"h":0.014028780592344359,"t":"What about graphics - whether there's anything visual in addition to the text?","c":1},{"x":0.22216924647278385,"y":0.25547088819701957,"h":0.015720002361967134,"c":1,"w":0.59271921793619797,"t":"Yes, you need to consider those, too, because they can have a big effect on the"},{"c":1,"x":0.22016459807924568,"y":0.27031802125868354,"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"reader's understanding of the story - sometimes a bigger effect than the text","w":0.57407409667968745},{"w":0.58652933756510417,"c":1,"y":0.28483634397967794,"h":0.014181993032933993,"t":"itself. Then you'll need to look at how the item is put together: what structure is","x":0.22217003050239933},{"t":"it given? Bear in mind that not many people read beyond the first paragraph,","x":0.22222222426828125,"y":0.29941860493173722,"w":0.56995885213216146,"c":1,"h":0.013081394460653373},{"c":1,"w":0.59053497314453118,"t":"so what has the journalist put at the beginning? And if, say, there are conflicting","x":0.22222222538128619,"y":0.31389870420903032,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"x":0.22222222486489596,"y":0.32848837196697511,"w":0.53909464518229167,"h":0.01308995562532056,"c":1,"t":"opinions about something, does one appear near the end, where people"},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"And newspapers sometimes give wrong or misleading information, don't they?","x":0.22222221822316138,"y":0.3574793877041702,"w":0.58230453491210943,"c":1},{"w":0.49199971516927077,"c":1,"t":"Either deliberately or by accident. Should I be looking at that, too?","y":0.37075900753814062,"x":0.22211271327536528,"h":0.016801521831462995},{"x":0.22222221991888641,"y":0.38662790685674997,"w":0.56995885213216146,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"t":"Yes, if you can. Compare what's in different versions, and as far as possible,"},{"x":0.2200748683074886,"y":0.39966604436113751,"t":"try and work out what's true and what isn't. And that relates to a very important","h":0.016853412273213797,"w":0.58868789672851562,"c":1},{"x":0.22210582202580875,"c":1,"y":0.41374819295023513,"w":0.60310816446940108,"t":"point: what's the writer's purpose, or at least the most important one, if they have","h":0.01797301468776169},{"c":1,"t":"several. It may seem to be to inform the public, but often it's that they want to","x":0.22222221113987398,"y":0.42873969378616417,"w":0.57407409667968756,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"y":0.44420278581288253,"h":0.01396222895250443,"t":"create fear, or controversy, or to make somebody look ridiculous.","x":0.22216715260583481,"c":1,"w":0.48569437662760412},{"t":"Gosh, I see what you mean. And I suppose the writer may make assumptions","c":1,"x":0.22417485380208177,"y":0.45613786863261896,"w":0.5763313802083333,"h":0.016936337007088964},{"h":0.013054620812441908,"t":"about the reader.","x":0.22204550976717205,"y":0.47251027755513564,"w":0.13004848480224609,"c":1},{"x":0.22216148351184814,"w":0.60094304402669263,"y":0.48680601373045718,"h":0.015923934774769499,"t":"That's right - about their knowledge of the subject, their attitudes, and their level","c":1},{"w":0.60092442830403647,"t":"of education, which means writing so that the readers understand without feeling","h":0.015091000793960307,"x":0.22217160367673566,"y":0.50118440190771996,"c":1},{"t":"patronised. All of that will make a difference to how the story is presented.","c":1,"x":0.22215083171678865,"h":0.015503663196721029,"y":0.51504682375234512,"w":0.54950012207031251},{"y":0.55226288870007734,"h":0.015647167592222733,"t":"Does it matter what type of story I write about?","c":1,"x":0.22213339383102693,"w":0.34998054504394527},{"t":"No - national or international politics, the arts... Anything, as long as it's covered","x":0.22222222353041693,"y":0.56684334491033495,"h":0.01309851566669662,"c":1,"w":0.60288065592447926},{"t":"in two or three newspapers. Though of course it'll be easier and more fun if it's","y":0.58041229081474477,"w":0.58655370076497393,"x":0.22214961935719021,"h":0.015150156122214375,"c":1},{"h":0.013081394460653484,"y":0.59593023278420809,"c":1,"x":0.22222222821059973,"t":"something you're interested in and know something about.","w":0.43621398925781246},{"x":0.22222222000542843,"t":"And on that basis a national news item would be worth analysing - I'm quite","y":0.61042402840774812,"w":0.56995885213216146,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"w":0.60082305908203126,"t":"keen on politics, so I'll try and find a suitable topic. What did you choose for your","h":0.011631330977620813,"x":0.22222221541030421,"y":0.62499999988841759,"c":1},{"w":0.11522633870442708,"y":0.63953488356760424,"t":"analysis, Tom?","x":0.22222222156213831,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.65400471135244465,"h":0.011778563015312216,"t":"I was interested in how newspapers express their opinions explicitly, so","x":0.22222221760241023,"w":0.5308642069498698},{"h":0.014534882858869502,"y":0.66715116304004196,"w":0.58230453491210943,"c":1,"t":"I wanted to compare editorials in different papers, but when I started looking, I","x":0.2222222251622579},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.22222222244467313,"c":1,"t":"couldn't find two on the same topic that I felt like analysing.","y":0.68313953476236444,"w":0.44238683064778639},{"y":0.69758539483470616,"t":"In that case, I won't even bother to look.","w":0.30041152954101563,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.2222222187501211},{"y":0.71220930221897505,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.224279823041488,"w":0.58024693806966143,"c":1,"t":"So in the end I chose a human interest story - a terribly emotional story about a"},{"h":0.015168391633230249,"w":0.57627273559570313,"y":0.72519131520044655,"x":0.22216179962711144,"c":1,"t":"young girl who was very ill, and lots of other people - mostly strangers - raised"},{"x":0.22416719045676453,"y":0.73845522878444547,"h":0.017572666927557767,"c":1,"t":"money so she could go abroad for treatment. Actually, I was surprised - some","w":0.5660970560709635},{"x":0.22417614665246277,"t":"papers just wrote about how wonderful everyone was, but others considered the","y":0.7529695565138057,"w":0.58454706827799474,"h":0.016184324370115744,"c":1},{"t":"broader picture, like why treatment wasn't available here.","c":1,"y":0.7674634018854255,"x":0.22413315000530276,"w":0.41792671203613285,"h":0.017100717209814875},{"h":0.016216462295945644,"c":1,"t":"Hmm, Iusually find stories like that raise quite strong feelings in me! I'Il","x":0.22215765239842181,"w":0.53101984659830737,"y":0.7829280334124965},{"c":1,"y":0.79775123112209756,"x":0.22215938667606017,"w":0.57419876098632816,"t":"avoid that. Perhaps I'Il choose an arts topic, like different reviews of a film, or","h":0.014776172008896249},{"y":0.81203606364853387,"w":0.43225641886393223,"t":"something about funding for the arts - I'll think about that.","h":0.015917159081628718,"c":1,"x":0.22212418302628484},{"w":0.22427983601888021,"t":"Yes, that might be interesting.","h":0.013089955625320671,"x":0.22427983496110357,"y":0.8284883719685846,"c":1},{"w":0.46913579305013026,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"t":"OK, well thanks a lot for your help, Tom. It's been really useful.","x":0.22222222684235399,"y":0.84156976730757482},{"x":0.22222222635918853,"w":0.41769546508789068,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"y":0.85600706733561294,"t":"You're welcome. Good luck with the assignment, Hazel."},{"y":0.91569767426017146,"w":0.03497942288716635,"x":0.13374485634834068,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"110"},{"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"Q22","x":0.8600823049144416,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"y":0.18313953474046896},{"c":1,"t":"Q23","x":0.8600823049144416,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.2412790696287499},{"x":0.86008230519736339,"t":"Q24","y":0.28343023283871394,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081394460653484,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.86008230492087134,"y":0.41424418590568224,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"Q25"},{"h":0.013081395583944833,"x":0.86008230492087134,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"Q26","c":1,"y":0.4578488370508691},{"t":"Q27","x":0.86008230513715245,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.60901162774581841,"c":1},{"t":"Q28","x":0.86008230513029349,"h":0.011627907185728703,"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"y":0.66715116264986807},{"y":0.78332689186342974,"w":0.035116154352823892,"x":0.86207155235720145,"h":0.011834588292349957,"c":1,"t":"Q29"},{"t":"Q30","x":0.86213991808959578,"w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1,"y":0.79796511613824039,"h":0.011627907185728592}],"w":2400}